msgstr ":doc:`张江AI创新小镇算力券、模型券、语料券 </funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers>` （费用补贴 · 不占股）： 核定实际支出最高100%，各类最高100万元，单个企业最多享受一年。状态：按季度申报，当前批次需确认。时间：按季度申报，确认当前批次。"

#: ../../districts/pudong.rst:86
msgid ""
":doc:`Lin-gang Zero Cube conditional rent support "
"</funding/zero-cube-rent>` (临港零界魔方有条件办公租金支持 · In-kind services · No "
"equity stated in offer; verify terms) — Qualifying offices: 3 years "
"rent-free, then 2 years at half rent; separate housing and service terms. "
"Status: Published service; current terms to confirm. Timing: Confirm "
"current community admission and tenancy terms."
msgstr ":doc:`临港零界魔方有条件办公租金支持 </funding/zero-cube-rent>` （实物及服务支持 · 公布方案未要求出让股权，具体以协议为准）： 符合条件的办公空间三年免租，后两年租金减半；住房及服务另有条款。状态：服务已公布，最新条款需确认。时间：确认社区现行入驻及租赁条款。"

#: ../../districts/pudong.rst:87
msgid ""
":doc:`Lin-gang OPC AI-tool service cost support "
"</funding/lingang-ai-tools>` (临港OPC人工智能工具服务费用支持 · Reimbursement · No "
"equity for qualifying public support) — Up to 80% of qualifying AI-tool "
"service costs; applicable caps and conditions require the implementing "
"notice. Status: Published policy; implementing intake to confirm. Timing: "
"Confirm current implementing notice and intake."
msgstr ":doc:`临港OPC人工智能工具服务费用支持 </funding/lingang-ai-tools>` （费用补贴 · 符合条件的财政支持不要求出让股权）： 符合条件的AI工具服务费用最高支持80%；具体限额及条件需确认实施通知。状态：政策已公布，实施细则及受理安排需确认。时间：确认现行实施通知及受理安排。"

#: ../../districts/pudong.rst:88
msgid ""
":doc:`Lin-gang OPC open-source AI-tool development reward "
"</funding/lingang-open-source-ai>` (临港OPC开源AI工具开发奖励 · Grant · No equity "
"for qualifying public support) — Annual reward up to RMB 1 million for "
"qualifying AI-tool development and listing on major international "
"open-source platforms. Status: Published policy; implementing intake to "
"confirm. Timing: Confirm current implementing notice and intake."
msgstr ":doc:`临港OPC开源AI工具开发奖励 </funding/lingang-open-source-ai>` （补助 · 符合条件的财政支持不要求出让股权）： 符合条件的AI工具开发并上架国际主流开源平台，年度奖励最高100万元。状态：政策已公布，实施细则及受理安排需确认。时间：确认现行实施通知及受理安排。"

#: ../../districts/pudong.rst:89
msgid ""
":doc:`Pudong foreign-funded R&D and open-innovation support "
"</funding/pudong-foreign-rd>` (浦东外资研发与开放创新支持 · Grant / market access · No "
"equity for qualifying public support) — Conditional R&D-center support "
"under the applicable recognition and funding rules; no universal cash "
"ceiling established. Status: Published policy; implementing intake to "
"confirm. Timing: Policy through 31 December 2027; confirm the "
"implementing call."
msgstr ":doc:`浦东外资研发与开放创新支持 </funding/pudong-foreign-rd>` （补助与市场准入 · 符合条件的财政支持不要求出让股权）： 按适用认定及资助规则给予有条件研发中心支持，未核实统一现金上限。状态：政策已公布，实施细则及受理安排需确认。时间：政策至2027年12月31日，须确认实施申报通知。"

